        "blockId": "syntax-concept",
        "dimensions": [
          "syntax",
          "concept"
        ],
        "text": "An earlier review是主语；would help缓和确定性；mitigate的宾语是the schedule risk。 较早发现问题可能留出处理时间，但不等于完全消除风险。原句没有量化减轻程度，也未承诺评审一定足够。",
        "sourceRefs": [
          {
            "sourceId": "oewn-2025",
            "sourceVersion": "2025",
            "locator": "entries-m.json/mitigate/v / mitigate%2:32:00::",
            "supportedClaim": "lessen or to try to lessen the seriousness or extent of",
            "url": "https://en-word.net/"
          }
        ],
        "title": "句子结构与当前所指"
      },
      {
        "blockId": "contrast",
        "dimensions": [
          "contrast"
        ],
        "text": "mitigate是减轻；eliminate是消除；accept a risk是接受残余风险，和采取减轻措施不是同一动作。",
        "sourceRefs": [],
        "title": "容易混淆的地方"
      },
      {
        "blockId": "game-neighbors",
        "dimensions": [
          "languageGame",
          "englishNeighbors"
        ],
        "text": "风险讨论应说明提前评审针对哪类问题、怎样降低影响以及还剩什么风险，后续再核对措施是否有效。 risk mitigation连接措施与风险；residual risk提醒措施后仍可能有剩余；earlier review说明此处提出的具体措施。",
        "sourceRefs": [],
        "title": "讨论通常怎样继续"
      },
      {
        "blockId": "action",
        "dimensions": [
          "pragmaticAction"
        ],
        "text": "说话者在提出改善安排并解释预期帮助，尚未报告风险已经降低。",
        "sourceRefs": [],
        "title": "说话者正在做什么"
      },
